-- Ekwo OS — Tanzania: chart of accounts, journals, taxes and defaults.
--
-- Generated from packs/tz at version 0.1.0, do not edit.
-- Change the pack and run `ekwo pack build tz`; `ekwo pack check --all`
-- refuses a seed that is not the exact output of its pack, and the CI runs it.
--
-- Community pack — not reviewed.
-- Written from:
--   The Value Added Tax Act, Chapter 148, Revised Edition 2019 (Attorney General's Chambers, United Republic of Tanzania)
--     https://www.mof.go.tz/uploads/documents/en-1676548670-THE%20VALUE%20ADDED%20TAX%20ACT,%20CAP%20148%20R.E.%202019.pdf
--   The Companies Act, 2002, Chapter 212 — ss. 151, 153, 154 (accounts and audit) (Tanzania Legal Information Institute (TanzLII) / Laws.Africa)
--     https://media.tanzlii.org/media/legislation/323287/source_file/9e4d2bac245b2936/2002-12.pdf
--   Value Added Tax (VAT) — rate, registration threshold, filing (Tanzania Revenue Authority)
--     https://www.tra.go.tz/page/value-added-tax-vat
--   Know about Electronic Fiscal Devices (EFD) (Tanzania Revenue Authority)
--     https://www.tra.go.tz/page/know-about-e-fiscal-devices-efd
--   IDRAS — the Integrated Domestic Revenue Administration System, where a value added tax return is filed (Tanzania Revenue Authority)
--     https://gateway.tra.go.tz/Efiling/login.aspx
--   Tanzania, United Republic of — Member Country (National Board of Accountants and Auditors: adoption of the IFRS Accounting Standards and the IFRS for SMEs Accounting Standard) (International Federation of Accountants)
--     https://www.ifac.org/about-ifac/membership/profile/tanzania-united-republic
--
-- Reference data: `install_country_template()` copies it into a company,
-- nothing here belongs to a company.

